{"module":"health","voice":"female","duration":164.9,"segments":[{"el":"title","text":"Health: segregated care and false beliefs about bodies","start":0.0,"end":4.14,"words":[[0.04,0.47],[0.77,1.72],[1.72,1.98],[1.98,2.24],[2.24,2.59],[2.59,3.11],[3.11,3.54],[3.54,3.97]]},{"el":"intro","text":"The medical abuses in the module on science are not the whole story.","start":4.94,"end":8.73,"words":[[4.99,5.12],[5.12,5.58],[5.58,6.03],[6.03,6.16],[6.16,6.29],[6.29,6.67],[6.67,6.8],[6.8,7.19],[7.19,7.25],[7.25,7.45],[7.45,7.58],[7.58,7.84],[7.84,8.22]]},{"el":"intro","text":"Everyday care has also been shaped by segregation and by false beliefs that Black bodies are different.","start":9.08,"end":15.56,"words":[[9.12,9.66],[9.66,9.89],[9.89,10.12],[10.12,10.5],[10.5,10.73],[10.73,11.12],[11.12,11.35],[11.35,12.2],[12.2,12.43],[12.43,12.66],[12.66,12.96],[12.96,13.43],[13.43,13.66],[13.66,13.96],[13.96,14.35],[14.35,14.43],[14.43,15.04]]},{"el":"h0","text":"Segregated hospitals","start":15.91,"end":17.79,"words":[[15.96,16.88],[16.88,17.63]]},{"el":"s0","text":"The Hill-Burton Act (1946) funded hospital construction and explicitly allowed “separate but equal” facilities.","start":18.49,"end":27.08,"words":[[18.54,18.7],[18.7,19.34],[19.34,19.58],[19.58,20.78],[21.06,21.54],[21.54,22.17],[22.17,23.05],[23.05,23.29],[23.29,24.17],[24.17,24.57],[24.57,25.05],[25.05,25.29],[25.29,25.69],[25.69,26.49]]},{"el":"s0","text":"A federal court struck that down in Simkins v. Moses H.","start":27.43,"end":31.48,"words":[[27.46,27.6],[27.6,28.08],[28.08,28.29],[28.29,28.64],[28.64,28.84],[28.84,29.12],[29.12,29.26],[29.26,29.74],[29.74,29.95],[30.29,30.71],[30.71,31.06]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Cone Memorial Hospital (1963).","start":31.83,"end":35.67,"words":[[31.83,32.18],[32.18,32.96],[32.96,33.65],[33.65,35.12]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Medicare, launched in 1966, finished the job: hospitals had to integrate to get paid, and about a thousand did so within months.","start":36.02,"end":45.44,"words":[[36.07,36.63],[36.87,37.29],[37.29,37.43],[37.43,38.67],[38.92,39.33],[39.33,39.47],[39.47,39.82],[40.06,40.68],[40.68,40.89],[40.89,41.03],[41.03,41.65],[41.65,41.79],[41.79,42.0],[42.0,42.35],[42.59,42.8],[42.8,43.15],[43.15,43.28],[43.28,43.77],[43.77,43.98],[43.98,44.18],[44.18,44.53],[44.53,44.95]]},{"el":"h1","text":"False beliefs about Black bodies","start":46.34,"end":49.09,"words":[[46.34,46.77],[46.77,47.43],[47.43,47.97],[47.97,48.4],[48.4,48.94]]},{"el":"s1","text":"A 2016 study in PNAS found that about half of the white medical students and residents surveyed believed at least one false claim about biological differences, such as Black people having thicker skin, and those who did rated Black patients' pain lower.","start":49.79,"end":66.22,"words":[[49.85,50.0],[50.0,50.98],[50.98,51.35],[51.35,51.5],[51.5,51.88],[51.88,52.26],[52.26,52.48],[52.48,52.86],[52.86,53.08],[53.08,53.23],[53.23,53.38],[53.38,53.68],[53.68,54.21],[54.21,54.88],[54.88,55.11],[55.11,55.79],[55.79,56.24],[56.24,56.69],[56.69,56.84],[56.84,57.14],[57.14,57.36],[57.36,57.66],[57.66,58.04],[58.04,58.41],[58.41,59.32],[59.32,60.07],[60.33,60.63],[60.63,60.78],[60.78,61.08],[61.08,61.46],[61.46,61.83],[61.83,62.13],[62.13,62.51],[62.77,63.0],[63.0,63.3],[63.3,63.45],[63.45,63.67],[63.67,64.12],[64.12,64.42],[64.42,65.02],[65.02,65.32],[65.32,65.7]]},{"el":"s1","text":"Pulse oximeters overestimate blood oxygen in patients with darker skin (New England Journal of Medicine, 2020), which can delay treatment.","start":66.57,"end":75.75,"words":[[66.62,66.9],[66.9,67.52],[67.52,68.36],[68.36,68.64],[68.64,69.19],[69.19,69.33],[69.33,69.89],[69.89,70.1],[70.1,70.37],[70.37,70.65],[70.65,70.86],[70.86,71.35],[71.35,71.77],[71.77,71.9],[71.9,72.39],[72.63,73.54],[73.78,74.06],[74.06,74.27],[74.27,74.62],[74.62,75.24]]},{"el":"s1","text":"Medical groups have removed race “corrections” from the kidney function formula (2021) and lung function tests (2023).","start":76.1,"end":84.53,"words":[[76.15,76.65],[76.65,77.01],[77.01,77.22],[77.22,77.65],[77.65,77.94],[77.94,78.58],[78.58,78.86],[78.86,79.0],[79.0,79.36],[79.36,79.86],[79.86,80.36],[80.36,81.43],[81.68,81.89],[81.89,82.1],[82.1,82.6],[82.6,82.96],[82.96,84.1]]},{"el":"h2","text":"The gap in years","start":85.43,"end":86.74,"words":[[85.48,85.68],[85.68,85.98],[85.98,86.18],[86.18,86.58]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Black Americans' life expectancy has been several years shorter than white Americans', about five years in recent CDC data.","start":87.44,"end":94.85,"words":[[87.5,87.78],[87.78,88.39],[88.39,88.66],[88.66,89.41],[89.41,89.61],[89.61,89.82],[89.82,90.23],[90.23,90.5],[90.5,90.77],[90.77,90.97],[90.97,91.25],[91.25,91.93],[92.16,92.5],[92.5,92.78],[92.78,93.05],[93.05,93.18],[93.18,93.59],[93.59,94.0],[94.0,94.41]]},{"el":"s2","text":"During COVID-19, Black, Hispanic and Native Americans were hospitalized and died at higher rates than white Americans (CDC).","start":95.2,"end":104.83,"words":[[95.23,95.8],[95.8,96.84],[97.13,97.53],[97.81,98.46],[98.46,98.7],[98.7,99.18],[99.18,99.91],[99.91,100.07],[100.07,101.04],[101.04,101.28],[101.28,101.6],[101.6,101.77],[101.77,102.09],[102.09,102.49],[102.49,102.73],[102.73,103.06],[103.06,103.78],[103.78,104.35]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Black maternal mortality is covered in the module on science.","start":105.18,"end":109.41,"words":[[105.24,105.56],[105.56,106.11],[106.11,106.75],[106.75,106.91],[106.91,107.31],[107.31,107.47],[107.47,107.63],[107.63,108.11],[108.11,108.27],[108.27,108.83]]},{"el":"h3","text":"Weathering, and doctors who look like you","start":110.31,"end":113.07,"words":[[110.36,111.03],[111.31,111.56],[111.56,112.06],[112.06,112.22],[112.22,112.47],[112.47,112.8],[112.8,112.97]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Public health researcher Arline Geronimus proposed in 1992 that the chronic stress of facing racism “weathers” bodies, causing earlier illness.","start":113.77,"end":123.2,"words":[[113.77,114.21],[114.21,114.51],[114.51,115.03],[115.03,115.4],[115.4,116.15],[116.15,116.74],[116.74,116.89],[116.89,118.0],[118.0,118.23],[118.23,118.38],[118.38,118.82],[118.82,119.19],[119.19,119.34],[119.34,119.79],[119.79,120.38],[120.38,120.76],[120.76,121.2],[121.46,121.83],[121.83,122.21],[122.21,122.65]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Many studies support the idea; the exact biological pathways are still debated.","start":123.55,"end":129.26,"words":[[123.6,123.91],[123.91,124.37],[124.37,124.75],[124.75,124.91],[124.91,125.36],[125.63,125.79],[125.79,126.24],[126.24,127.16],[127.16,127.7],[127.7,127.77],[127.77,128.08],[128.08,128.77]]},{"el":"s3","text":"A 2020 study found Black newborns were more likely to survive when cared for by Black doctors; a 2024 reanalysis argued the effect mostly disappears after accounting for very low birth weight.","start":129.61,"end":142.42,"words":[[129.64,129.8],[129.8,130.7],[130.7,131.08],[131.08,131.46],[131.46,131.76],[131.76,132.29],[132.29,132.44],[132.44,132.59],[132.59,133.04],[133.04,133.19],[133.19,133.65],[133.65,133.87],[133.87,134.18],[134.18,134.33],[134.33,134.55],[134.55,134.86],[134.86,135.39],[135.65,135.8],[135.8,136.86],[136.86,137.69],[137.69,138.07],[138.07,138.22],[138.22,138.6],[138.6,139.12],[139.12,139.73],[139.73,140.03],[140.03,140.63],[140.63,140.79],[140.79,141.09],[141.09,141.31],[141.31,141.54],[141.54,141.92]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Both studies are serious; the question isn't settled.","start":142.77,"end":146.19,"words":[[142.84,143.1],[143.1,143.48],[143.48,143.54],[143.54,144.11],[144.33,144.46],[144.46,144.97],[144.97,145.28],[145.28,145.73]]},{"el":"h4","text":"What helps","start":147.09,"end":148.08,"words":[[147.13,147.44],[147.44,147.97]]},{"el":"s4","text":"More Black doctors, nurses and midwives; community health workers and doulas; insurance coverage; and removing race-based shortcuts from clinical tools.","start":148.78,"end":159.55,"words":[[148.83,148.99],[148.99,149.3],[149.3,149.84],[150.11,150.49],[150.49,150.73],[150.73,151.42],[151.69,152.39],[152.39,152.69],[152.69,153.08],[153.08,153.31],[153.31,153.77],[154.04,154.74],[154.74,155.43],[155.7,155.94],[155.94,156.48],[156.48,157.17],[157.17,157.71],[157.71,158.02],[158.02,158.64],[158.64,159.02]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Health professionals can give their skills through the pro bono quests.","start":159.9,"end":163.98,"words":[[159.92,160.2],[160.2,160.98],[160.98,161.2],[161.2,161.41],[161.41,161.62],[161.62,161.98],[161.98,162.19],[162.19,162.33],[162.33,162.62],[162.62,163.04],[163.04,163.54]]}]}